    {
      "id": 143563,
      "name": "Ronway",
      "username": "Ronway",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-06-30T21:59:17.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It should also be noted that you choose a target, then redirect if needed, choose the next target, redirecting if needed. If you have 5 relics in play, with Orb at 3 HP, you could hit it first, then target two other relics, causing it to be destroyed. That will allow the other 2 relics to be hit.</p><p>Another note of importance, if a target has DR that would reduce the damage to 0, then no redirection would occur. So without damage increases or irreducible damage, targeting Condemnation will not trigger a redirection.</p>",
      "post_number": 3,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:21:00.797Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
