      "id": 143565,
      "name": "Ameena",
      "username": "Ameena",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-07-01T14:00:47.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Just to check something…you know you never <span class=\"bbcode-i\">have</span> to draw during your draw phase, right? You only ever <span class=\"bbcode-i\">have</span> to if something says \"draw a card\" (as opposed to \"you <span class=\"bbcode-i\">may</span> draw a card\"). So you can avoid Apostate playing extra cards via the Tome at the cost of not getting any extra cards yourself.</p>",
      "post_number": 5,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:21:00.942Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
